content_md:
The scythe of the elune drop chance in kara10 is fine, it helps to keep a low-level raid relevant; the mistakes was on the 100% "soul of the dreadlord" drop chance;
I guess Thunderfury bindings drop chances could have been an example to use. Moreover, a world boss requiring three raid groups is kinda too much.
Anyway, even though I mainly play physical DPS, I'm glad they introduced this kind of item (also respecting the lore).

I agree with the matter of the topic, from a playability Starfire feels to slow;
Ofc, doubling the beneficial effect of improved Starfire would be too much especially PvP-wise.
Still it would be better to sacrifice its chance to stun to get an extra 0.5 cast reduction from spell crits with three talent points spent on it.
